Files changed: NEW games/{write.html,write.js,write.css,strokes.json,strokes.js,build-strokes.js}; index.html (card + i-pen symbol, .more 5 cols); lessons/article.html, lessons/story.html (.game-link); assets/kids.css (+.game-link); lessons/presentation/build/{build.py,deck.css} → lessons/presentation.html; book/tools/story-template.html → book/books/noori-shell.html (new-story.js only, no print-book.sh); README.md row
Findings:
  [MINOR] [A11Y] the deck's game link scales with the stage: 357×48 at 1280, 109×15 at 390 — same class as REVIEW #13; deck is TV/iPad — left as is
  [MINOR] [A11Y] the canvas has no keyboard path — Watch mode + Noori's help after 3 tries reach the stars without fine motor
Decisions / judgement calls:
  - One source of truth: games/strokes.json → `node games/build-strokes.js` → strokes.js (window.STROKES) for file://; the build lints start == path M point
  - Letters are thick round SVG strokes (the stroke model IS the visible letter); the Naskh word is shown small beneath ("نَقْرَأُ")
  - viewBox x from the strokes' bbox (min 300 wide), y 38–290; canvas maps pointer → viewBox units, so tolerance is in letter units at any size
  - Check: start ≤40u of the dot; ≥70% of the child's points ≤28u of the line; ≥70% of the model covered; direction by sequence-aware nearest index (≥75% forward) — handles loops (ه, ة) and retraced teeth (بِنْتٌ); dots by centroid ≤34u; tol ×1.2/try (max 1.6); 3rd miss → Noori draws it
  - Numbered badge offset off the line, small green dot at the exact start; arrows on body strokes only (they hid short harakat in the static view)
  - Sound off unless a saved choice exists (KS.muted=true, not stored); deep link ?item=<id>; lessons → taa-m, book pads → the matching item
Fixed this run:
  - Built the game — verified by Playwright (scratchpad/wg/test.cjs, test2.cjs) at 1280×800, 820×1180, 390×844: 0 console errors, 0 failed requests, 0 hscroll, 0 controls < 56 px
  - Pass/miss on baa, taa-final, hatha, bint at all 3 sizes: reversed stroke → stays on step 1 + hint; stroke shifted 70u → hint; correct strokes advance 1..n → data-done=1
  - 3 misses → help advances (noon); dot shifted 60u → hint, on the dot → done; step-by-step 1 then 2 strokes; reduced motion: all 7 strokes + 7 numbers at once, miss shows the stroke statically
  - 6 themes × 2 art modes: 0 hscroll, 0 errors; file:// write.html works; links from hub/article/story/deck resolve on file://; 9 book pad pages carry a 68 px link
  - Deck: run.sh 0 issues; run.sh --themes 7/7 0 issues (link bg made transparent after keynote-black/studio contrast fails)
